<body># 🌿 VAYUNI — Where Imagination Comes Alive<br/><br/>**VAYUNI** is a unified, interactive web portal blending modern curiosity with ancient Indian wisdom. Designed with an emerald-and-gold glassmorphic interface, it brings together six core pillars of learning and inspiration in one fast, responsive web app.<br/><br/>## ✨ Core Features<br/>- **❝ Quotes &amp; Subhashitams:** Inspiring thoughts alongside traditional Sanskrit verses and meanings.<br/>- **⚗️ Science:** Bite-sized explanations of everyday physics, space, and natural phenomena with mini home experiments.<br/>- **💡 Discoveries &amp; Inventions:** Key milestones from ancient Indian mathematics (like *Shunya* / Zero) to modern breakthroughs.<br/>- **🌐 Did You Know &amp; Learn a Language:** Daily vocabulary, fun linguistic facts, and multi-language greetings.<br/>- **🪷 Spiritual Library (Vignanam Mode):** Read Vedic chants, stotrams, and Bhagavad Gita shlokas with instant script switching across **English, Devanagari (देवनागरी), Telugu (తెలుగు), and Tamil (தமிழ்)**, plus a daily Panchangam bar.<br/>- **🎬 Fun AI Videos:** Curated AI-generated animated storyboards and educational shorts.<br/>- **🔍 Live Search &amp; Filtering:** Instant keyword search across all stotrams, quotes, and science articles.<br/><br/>## 🛠️ Built With<br/>- **HTML5** — Semantic structure (`index.html`)<br/>- **CSS3** — Custom emerald &amp; gold gradients, responsive grid, and glassmorphism (`style.css`)<br/>- **Vanilla JavaScript** — Dynamic category filtering, real-time search, and multi-script text rendering (`script.js`)<br/><br/>## 🚀 Live Demo<br/>Hosted via **GitHub Pages** at `https://&lt;your-username&gt;.github.io/vayuni/`<br/></body>
